{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55419","headline":"萍乡春晚寓居（四首） 三 · 沈彬","name":"萍乡春晚寓居（四首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄鸟垂杨一两声，流年流去不胜情。\n已伤野径锁春色，空睡山窻愁月明。\n金山真堪沽酒散，山河到了爲谁争。\n古人尽入平芜去，虚对冯唐夸後生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}